<title>FRANCE: Ecia sales rise 3.8 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Ecia sales rise 3.8 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 9,453    vs    9,106</p>
<p>NOTE - Car parts manufacturer Ecia, controlled by PSA Peugeot Citroen, said sales rose 3.8 percent in 1996. On a comparable basis, they rose 1.4 percent, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
